---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../lib/site';

const breadcrumbs = [{ label: 'Home', href: '/' }, { label: 'Privacy' }];
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="What this site collects, what it does not collect, and how to contact us about privacy."
  breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}
  updated="16 November 2026"
>
  <p>
    This policy explains the limited data this site handles. It is written for students
    and is intentionally short because the site is designed to collect as little as
    possible.
  </p>

  <h2>What we do not collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>No accounts, logins, or passwords.</li>
    <li>No roll numbers, registration numbers, marks, or result credentials.</li>
    <li>No payment or card data on this site.</li>
    <li>No advertising cookies or third-party tracking pixels at launch.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>
    At launch we use Cloudflare Web Analytics, which is cookieless and does not build a
    cross-site profile of you. It provides aggregate page views and performance data. If
    we add a different analytics tool later, this policy will be updated before it goes
    live.
  </p>

  <h2>Server logs</h2>
  <p>
    Our hosting provider may process standard technical logs such as IP address, user
    agent, requested URL, and timestamp for security, abuse prevention, and reliability.
    We do not use these logs to identify individual students.
  </p>

  <h2>Search</h2>
  <p>
    Site search uses a static index generated at build time. Your query is processed in
    your browser and is not sent to a third-party search API.
  </p>

  <h2>Email</h2>
  <p>
    If you email us, we receive your email address and whatever you include in the
    message. We use it only to respond, investigate a correction, or handle a complaint.
    Do not send sensitive personal data.
  </p>

  <h2>Advertising</h2>
  <p>
    If advertising is enabled in the future, the ad provider may use cookies or similar
    technologies and this policy will be updated to describe them. We will not place ads
    that look like download buttons or hide the real download link.
  </p>

  <h2>Your choices</h2>
  <p>
    You can browse the site without providing any personal data. If you have sent us an
    email and want it deleted, contact us and we will remove it unless we need to keep it
    for a legal or complaint record.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Privacy questions: <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>
  </p>
  <p class="text-sm text-stone-500">
    TODO: replace the placeholder email address before launch and update this policy if
    ads, forms, or a different analytics provider are added.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
